{"ref":"BDB, חָסֵר²","hw":"חָסֵר²","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">חָסֵר</span></big>  <strong>adj. needy, lacking, in want of</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳</span> abs. <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 6:2\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.6.2\">Ec 6:2</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲסַר</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 21:16\" href=\"/I_Samuel.21.16\">1 S 21:16</a> + 13 times;—<em>needy, in want of</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳ משׁגעים אני</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 21:16\" href=\"/I_Samuel.21.16\">1 S 21:16</a> <em>am I in want of madmen?</em> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 3:29\" href=\"/II_Samuel.3.29\">2 S 3:29</a> <em>in need of bread</em>, so <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 12:9\" href=\"/Proverbs.12.9\">Pr 12:9</a>; usually <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲסַר־לֵב</span> <em>lacking understanding, sense</em> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 6:32\" href=\"/Proverbs.6.32\">Pr 6:32</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 7:7\" href=\"/Proverbs.7.7\">7:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 9:4\" href=\"/Proverbs.9.4\">9:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 9:16\" href=\"/Proverbs.9.16\">16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 10:13\" href=\"/Proverbs.10.13\">10:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 11:12\" href=\"/Proverbs.11.12\">11:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 12:11\" href=\"/Proverbs.12.11\">12:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 15:21\" href=\"/Proverbs.15.21\">15:21</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אָדָם ח׳־לֵב</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 17:18\" href=\"/Proverbs.17.18\">Pr 17:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 24:30\" href=\"/Proverbs.24.30\">24:30</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">נָּגִיד ח׳ תְּבוּנוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 28:16\" href=\"/Proverbs.28.16\">Pr 28:16</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵינֶנּוּ חָסֵר לְנַפְשׁוֹ מִכֹּל וג׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 6:2\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.6.2\">Ec 6:2</a> <em>neither is he lacking for his soul in aught of</em> (<span dir=\"rtl\">מן</span> part.) <em>all that he desireth</em>.","next":"BDB, חַסְרָה","prev":"BDB, חֹ֫סֶר"}